  - interactable: {fileID: 7063}
    objectiveTitle: "B\u0130Z \u0130Y\u0130Y\u0130Z D\u0130YE SES VER"
    objectiveDetail: "Devrilmi\u015F dolaba dokunma; kap\u0131n\u0131n a\xE7\u0131kta
      kalan ger\xE7ek kenar\u0131na \xFC\xE7 kez vur."
    completionSubtitle: "Deniz kap\u0131n\u0131n kenar\u0131na \xFC\xE7 kez vuruyor:
      Biz iyiyiz, Can yan\u0131mda! Aral\u0131ktan s\u0131cak bir \u0131\u015F\u0131k
      geliyor. Baba cevap verirken tavandan ince toz d\xF6k\xFCl\xFCyor; Can sesi
      \xF6nce fark edip i\xE7 duvar\u0131 g\xF6steriyor."
    delayAfter: 2.8
  - interactable: {fileID: 813764368}
    objectiveTitle: "CAN B\u0130R SES DUYDU"
    objectiveDetail: "Can'\u0131n i\u015Faret etti\u011Fi i\xE7 duvar taraf\u0131nda
      yan\u0131nda kal; ince titre\u015Fim bitene kadar omzunda bas\u0131l\u0131
      tut."
    completionSubtitle: "Can: Dur, tavandan yine ses geliyor. Deniz onun uyar\u0131s\u0131na
      g\xFCvenip yan\u0131nda \xE7\xF6k\xFCyor; ikisi de merdivene ko\u015Fmuyor."
    delayAfter: 2.2
